---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Monitor Your Donations — VisibleAid" active="monitor">

<header class="hero" style="min-height:0;">
	<div class="hero-photo" style="height:260px;">
		<div class="hero-scrim"></div>
		<div class="hero-content" style="padding:40px 0 36px;">
			<div class="wrap">
				<div class="inner">
					<p class="eyebrow">Why VisibleAid is different</p>
					<h1 style="font-size:34px;">Monitor your donations</h1>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</header>

<section class="block">
	<div class="wrap">
		<div class="section-head">
			<p>Most charities ask you to trust that your money was used well. VisibleAid is built so you don't have to just trust — you can check, any time you want.</p>
		</div>

		<table class="compare">
			<thead>
				<tr>
					<th></th>
					<th class="other">Typical charity</th>
					<th class="us">VisibleAid</th>
				</tr>
			</thead>
			<tbody>
				<tr>
					<td>Visibility</td>
					<td class="other">Give money and hope it's used well — you rarely see the result.</td>
					<td class="us"><span class="ok">&#10003;</span>See your donation at work: live stats and photos, online, any time.</td>
				</tr>
				<tr>
					<td>Longevity</td>
					<td class="other">A donation helps once, then it's gone.</td>
					<td class="us"><span class="ok">&#10003;</span>The building keeps housing people for decades — when a resident passes, the room helps the next person with nowhere else to go.</td>
				</tr>
				<tr>
					<td>Proof of progress</td>
					<td class="other">An annual letter or newsletter, long after the fact.</td>
					<td class="us"><span class="ok">&#10003;</span>Quarterly construction photos from groundbreaking to move-in, then ongoing.</td>
				</tr>
				<tr>
					<td>Where the money goes</td>
					<td class="other">A general fund, mixed with thousands of other donations.</td>
					<td class="us"><span class="ok">&#10003;</span>Your facility, with its own page, its own address, its own numbers.</td>
				</tr>
				<tr>
					<td>Who's accountable</td>
					<td class="other">A head office, far from where the money is spent.</td>
					<td class="us"><span class="ok">&#10003;</span>A local resident committee and NGO partner, with your own visit welcome.</td>
				</tr>
			</tbody>
		</table>
	</div>
</section>

<section class="block alt">
	<div class="wrap">
		<div class="donate-banner">
			<h3>Every facility is a promise you can check on.</h3>
			<a class="btn btn-primary" href="/facilities">See a real facility &#8599;</a>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

</Layout>
